{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2025-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1755993600, "end_date": 1756684799, "month_true_total": 181, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:55:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "203275687", "author": {"steamid": "76561198889990493", "personaname": "C0ld Ramen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SophieDaRatMaster/", "num_games_owned": 149, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 20734, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17705, "deck_playtime_at_review": 7730, "last_played": 1788795483, "avatar": "ac097716dddbcab046de46b8b22494eb24d095b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Seasonal content is the best thing that's ever happened to this game. As of writing this review the game is on Season 5: Arcane Talisman, which is by far my favorite season. Each season is a permanent addition to the game play modifiers alongside their rewards for completing their respective battle passes. So there's no FOMO when it comes to skipping a season because all the content can be accessed and/ unlocked at any time using Spiritual Essence (In game currency you get for playing the game.) Outside of the yearly DLC drop, all content in updates are free on top of that.\n\nMy only major complaint about this game is that Spiritual Assault has been essentially shafted in terms of getting new content. The game mode is a pretty fun and challenging survival mode. Build your character and survive for 30 minutes then face a boss. The mode does have a difficulty spike every 10 minutes or so to test your builds. I've been filtered so many times cause I couldn't deal any substantial damage to elite enemies once the 10 minute mark rolls around. I'm sad that there are only 2 maps and the mode hasn't been touched since 2023. I hope one day that the mode gets the promised content and a wave based survival mode that's endless.", "timestamp_created": 1756667960, "timestamp_updated": 1756667960, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15842", "os": "Bazzite", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5500                               ", "adapter_description": "AMD AMD Radeon RX 7600 (radeonsi, navi33, ACO, DRM 3.64, 7.2.0-ogc6.1.fc44.x86_64)", "vram_size": 8192}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203261581", "author": {"steamid": "76561198198084934", "personaname": "DeathMint", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DeathMintDeluxe/", "num_games_owned": 226, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 3080, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1740, "last_played": 1771570904, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "Highly recommend this game. It's an adorable arcade shooter with some roguelike/randomization that changes it up every playthru. I played back when it first came out and I'm proud as can be that the Devs are still making content and adding to the game! As of this review, there's a fourth update coming down the turnpike, and I might not have a lot of hours into the game but to me? THIS is a comfort game.", "timestamp_created": 1756654354, "timestamp_updated": 1756654354, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "203253379", "author": {"steamid": "76561198239298650", "personaname": "Shadow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/84824488/", "num_games_owned": 278, "num_